 [17592186534908 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186534560 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186534908 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186534697 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186534908 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186534801 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186534908 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186534908 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186534908 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186534560 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186534908 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "8f7fa629-9baf-529b-99af-39063b4618f6" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186534918 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186534308 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186534918 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186534489 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186534918 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186534492 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186534918 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186534515 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186534918 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186534621 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186534918 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186534918 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186534918 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186534621 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186534918 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "9ca90436-78d3-5958-bb30-5ff0939b26c6" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186534934 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186534307 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186534934 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186534311 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186534934 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186534454 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186534934 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186534535 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186534934 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186534688 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186534934 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186534934 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186534934 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186534307 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186534934 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "b199132b-7b0e-5674-af57-8442f38abdba" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186534985 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186534918 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186534985 #edb/ref 1069 "q-104972" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186534985 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186534985 #edb/ref 1071 "The function \n$f(x,y)$ \nhas the second derivative\n\n$$\n{f}^{″}(x,y)=[\\begin{aligned}-2y & 4y-2x \\\\ 4y-2x & 4x\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nand has a stationary point at $(1,1).$ If $H$ denotes the Hessian determinant of $f,$ which of the following statements are true?\n\nI. $H(1,1)>0$\n\nII. $\\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}^{2}}(1,1)<0$\n\nIII. The point $(1,1)$ is a saddle point of $f$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186534985 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "22b41189-2cbf-5d3c-9c30-272b9cf4d5e7" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186534985 #edb/ref 1074 "The second partial derivative test states that if $a\\in {R}^{2}$ is a stationary point of $f(x,y)$ with Hessian determinant $H(a),$ we have the following:\n\n- If $H(a)>0,$ then:\n\n- if $\\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}^{2}}(a)<0,$ then $f$ has a local maximum at $a$\n\n- if $\\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}^{2}}(a)>0,$ then $f$ has a local minimum at $a$\n\n- If $H(a)<0,$ then $f$ has a saddle point at $a$\n\n- If $H(a)=0,$ then the second partial derivatives test is inconclusive.\n\nEvaluating the second derivative at $(1,1),$ we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{″}(1,1)=[\\begin{aligned}-2 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 4\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, let's examine our statements in turn.\n\n- Statement I is false. Computing the determinant of ${f}^{″}(1,1),$ we get\n\n$$\nH(1,1)=det({f}^{″}(1,1))=(-2)\\cdot 4-{2}^{2}=-12<0.\n$$\n\n- Statement II is true. Indeed, we have $\\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}^{2}}(1,1)=({f}^{″}(1,1))_{11}=-2<0.$\n\n- Statement III is true. Indeed, since $H(1,1)<0,$ the point $(1,1)$ is a saddle point by the second partial derivative test.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II and III only.\"" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186535110 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186535129 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186535110 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "7680f643-a75d-57d6-8c87-a026935d52e1" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186535110 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186535054 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186535118 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186535110 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186535118 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "968d2559-6e9f-56e6-9b9e-123351a336d0" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186535118 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186125083 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186535129 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186535142 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186535129 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "ce1efa80-0c1d-5262-b0b5-0d1381771d5b" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186535129 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186535048 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186535135 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "d671a181-8f1a-54af-9310-de7ad818f73c" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186535135 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186520472 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186535142 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186535135 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186535142 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "f91e8e6a-a7db-5d9a-8fbc-5c958203d35d" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186535142 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186534985 #edb/ref 17592186045417]}
